{"slug":"PostProcessVolume","name":"PostProcessVolume","namespace":"Ara","kind":"struct","declaration":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> PostProcessVolume</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> : </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">IComponent</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">PostProcessVolume</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">></span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>A region whose post-processing overrides blend in as the camera approaches and enters it. Volumes apply in ascending <code>priority</code> (ties in entity ID order); each property one overrides moves toward its value by the volume&#39;s weight at the camera. Properties no volume overrides keep the engine defaults. Scenes saved with the former <code>PostProcess</code> component load as one global volume that overrides everything.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"members":[{"kind":"property","name":"TypeIndex","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> static</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> uint</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> TypeIndex { get; }</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Stable engine component index.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"Shape","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> VolumeShape</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Shape;</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Where the volume applies: everywhere, or inside a box or sphere placed and sized by the entity&#39;s transform.</p>\n","remarks":"<p>Default: &quot;global&quot;.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"BlendDistance","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> float</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> BlendDistance;</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Distance outside the box or sphere over which the volume fades out; 0 is a hard edge.</p>\n","remarks":"<p>Unit: m. Range: [0, 1000]. Default: 0.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"Priority","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> float</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Priority;</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Order among overlapping volumes: higher priorities apply after, and over, lower ones.</p>\n","remarks":"<p>Range: [-1000, 1000]. Default: 0.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"Weight","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> float</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Weight;</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>Overall strength of the volume&#39;s overrides, from 0 (none) to 1 (full).</p>\n","remarks":"<p>Range: [0, 1]. Default: 1.</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"Overrides","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> PostOverride</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">[] Overrides;</span></span></code></pre>","summary":"<p>The settings this volume changes, one entry per group. Anything not listed comes from lower-priority volumes or the defaults.</p>\n","remarks":"<p>Default: [].</p>\n","typeParams":[],"params":[]},{"kind":"method","name":"Access","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> static</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> PostProcessVolume</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> Access</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">Entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> entity, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">bool</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> write);</span></span></code></pre>","typeParams":[],"params":[{"name":"entity"},{"name":"write"}]},{"kind":"method","name":"Insert","signature":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> static</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> Insert</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">in</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Commands</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> commands, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code